dot/pulls/123701","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123701","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123701.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123701.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-22T19:09:49Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Speeds up GDScript setters\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nUses the same mechanism from #123531 to avoiding copying a Variant when an implicit conversion is possible.\r\n\r\n## Benchmarks\r\n\r\nProject: [gdscript-set.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32498266/gdscript-set.zip)\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Setup and scenarios</summary>\r\n\r\nClass to set value on:\r\n```gdscript\r\nclass_name A extends Object\r\n\r\nvar x: int\r\nvar y: Y\r\n\r\nclass Y extends RefCounted:\r\n\tpass\r\n```\r\n\r\n### A: Int\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar a := A.new()\r\nfor i in N:\r\n    a.x = 1\r\n```\r\n\r\n### B: Float\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar a := A.new()\r\nfor i in N:\r\n    a.x = 1.1\r\n```\r\n\r\n### C: RefCounted\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar a := A.new()\r\nvar y := A.Y.new()\r\nfor i in N:\r\n    a.y = y\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Device specs</summary>\r\nCPU: AMD 9800X3D, GPU: AMD RX 6800, RAM: 32GB DDR5 6400 CL28, Windows 11, Built with GCC (MinGW)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nEach scenario is run in a loop of `N=100_000_000`. The test is run 15 times on release templates and the 20th percentile is summarized below:\r\n\r\n| Scenario | PR (ns/op) | Master (ns/op) | Diff | Speedup |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| A (int) | 13.15 | 13.82 | 0.67 | 1.05x |\r\n| B (float -> int) | 13.15 | 13.80 | 0.65 | 1.05x |\r\n| C (RefCounted) | 31.29 | 49.22 | 17.93 | 1.57x |\r\n\r\n*Edit 24/09: I realized the ns/op calculations were wrong but the relative speedup is still correct, values updated!*\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123701/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":4,"eyes":4},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123701/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}